  <tei:text>
    <tei:body>
      <tei:div corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/125">
        <tei:head xml:lang="en">Psalm 125</tei:head>
        <tei:p><tei:note type="instruction" xml:lang="en">This Psalm expounds the theme of our trust in God. It proclaims that through God's Divine protection, which visibly accompanied Israel at all times, we have found security.</tei:note><tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/125/1"/>A Song of Ascents.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/125/2"/>Those who trust in Adonoy
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/125/3"/>are as Mount Zion which cannot be moved,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/125/4"/>but abides forever.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/125/5"/>Jerusalem is surrounded by mountains,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/125/6"/>and Adonoy is around His people,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/125/7"/>from now forever.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/125/8"/>For it will not rest [for long]
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/125/9"/>the reign of wickedness
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/125/10"/>upon the lot of the righteous;
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/125/11"/>in order that the righteous will not put forth
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/125/12"/>their hands unto iniquity.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/125/13"/>Do good, Adonoy, to those who are good,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/125/14"/>and to those who are upright in their hearts.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/125/15"/>And as for those who turn aside
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/125/16"/>to their crooked ways,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/125/17"/>Adonoy will lead them away
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/125/18"/>together with the workers of iniquity;
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/125/19"/>peace be upon Israel.</tei:p>
      </tei:div>
